	'ka1aefdf4' => 'Looks after twenty-two apartments on six floors, from key handover through each monthly check-in.',
	'ka2116951' => 'We offer four apartment types across fifty-four residences. The Studio of 28 square metres is €2,150 per month. The Desk studio of 34 square metres is €2,460 per month. The One-bedroom apartment of 42 square metres is €2,780 per month. The Two-bedroom apartment of 64 square metres is €3,640 per month. All rates include utilities, Wi-Fi, and weekly housekeeping.',
	'ka217dbec' => 'Returning to the Street',
	'ka3bb1d14' => 'Our three house managers provide a continuous, welcoming presence at our front desks from 08:00 to 20:00 daily. Tomasz Wierzbicki manages Ashgrove House, overseeing its fourteen apartments and historic brick architecture. Amara Okafor leads Canal Row, caring for twenty-two waterfront warehouse apartments and managing resident parking. Lena Hartmann manages Linden Court, stewarding eighteen apartments and its central birch courtyard. Each house manager personally welcomes arriving residents with a 45-minute walk-through, coordinates housekeeping, and preserves a quiet, orderly atmosphere throughout the building.',
	'ka44588ab' => 'One-bedroom',
	'ka55ef468' => 'Agreement and deposit',
	'ka5701af3' => 'Residents’ stories',
	'ka5a5a31f' => 'The security deposit is equal to one month\'s rent for your chosen apartment. It is paid upon signing the residency agreement to secure your reservation. When you depart, your house manager conducts a brief walk-through inspection with you. Provided the apartment and furnishings are in good condition, your deposit is refunded in full to your bank account following the departure inspection.',
	'ka5f3c6a1' => 'K',
	'ka6a0b170' => 'A 20-minute call and the apartment choice.',
	'ka6d58c2d' => 'See the houses',
	'ka73b10f4' => 'Bills, Wi-Fi, and weekly linen and clean are included in the monthly rent. The deposit is one month’s rent. Minimum stay is thirty nights, and notice to leave is thirty days.',
	'kabd7f796' => 'Since 2014 · Calder Harbour',
	'kac360b7f' => '€45 per visit',
	'kaf5f3a54' => 'During your residency, our housekeeping team performs weekly cleaning and linen changes on a scheduled weekday. Every month, your house manager conducts a brief, courteous check-in to confirm that everything in your apartment is functioning smoothly. Maintenance technician Mateo Rossi attends to any necessary repairs quickly and discreetly. Monthly rent is invoiced on the first of each month, with 30 days notice required for extensions or early departures. For after-hours assistance, our dedicated night line remains active 24 hours a day.',
	'kb1c6ed19' => 'View house',
	'kb2d95df6' => 'By midday, natural daylight fills the living spaces and courtyard gardens. Residents working from their apartments step away from their desks, heating lunch in their private kitchenette or walking a few minutes to the local market stalls for fresh produce. In the shared ground-floor kitchen, residents occasionally meet to exchange greetings while preparing tea. The front desk team is on duty, receiving postal parcels, greeting visitors, and sorting mail into resident pigeonholes. The atmosphere remains peaceful and focused, offering long-term guests a quiet sanctuary in the middle of a productive working day.',
	'kb4cde71b' => 'The first hour: keys at the desk, then the walk-through.',
	'kb847bf93' => 'When your stay reaches its conclusion, we ensure an unhurried, organized departure. Exactly 2 days before your departure date, your house manager meets you for a brief leaving check to review apartment condition and finalize details. We provide a simple leaving checklist covering key returns, mail forwarding, and final invoice settlement. Following inspection, your one-month deposit is refunded in full to your bank account. You simply return your physical keys to the front desk when departing.',
	'kb9ece18c' => 'T',
	'kba670855' => 'We simplify housing administration for corporate mobility leaders, human resource teams, and project managers. Stays begin at thirty nights and can be adjusted with thirty days notice as project timelines change. Company accounts receive consolidated monthly invoices detailing all accommodation costs, utilities, Wi-Fi, and weekly housekeeping. We eliminate individual utility contracts, security deposit complications, and third-party booking fees. Payments are easily processed via bank transfer, providing your organization with clear, predictable accounting and complete contractual transparency from start to finish.',
	'kbaaacd72' => 'Parking',
	'kbc0cad6a' => 'The desk by the window is yours again. The laptop is closed and the lamp is on, with dusk in the street. You write, or you leave the notebook shut for the night.',
	'kbcd1e2f0' => 'Project teams',
	'kbd54671c' => '€2,460 / month',
	'kc1d9f50f' => 'H',
	'kc3755e61' => 'Call',
