	'kc72fde09' => 'House manager, Canal Row',
	'kc8a29445' => 'Canal Row only',
	'kc92ef27b' => 'You choose a studio, a desk studio, a one-bedroom, or a two-bedroom, and the house that fits your walk. Size and rent are settled before the call ends.',
	'kcbabbc3b' => 'Tell us your dates.',
	'kcd6c2bbc' => 'Priya N., Structural Engineer — Canal Row',
	'kce0d44a9' => 'Leads housekeeping across all three houses.',
	'kd0c02a62' => 'Amara Okafor',
	'kd129e0cc' => 'House manager · Canal Row · Front desk 08:00–20:00',
	'kd26af0c3' => 'What is included in the monthly rate?',
	'kd2d6d975' => 'Rent includes bills, Wi-Fi, and a weekly linen change and clean. Apartments run from a 28 m² studio to a 64 m² two-bedroom, and the laundry room and shared kitchen table are on the ground floor of each house.',
