	'ke38c11f6' => '12:30 · the shared table',
	'ke4063cd2' => 'Our monthly rates are fully inclusive and transparent. Your rent covers all utility expenses—heating, water, electricity, and gas—as well as high-speed Wi-Fi and weekly housekeeping with fresh linen and towel replacement. There are no additional condominium service fees, local taxes, or building administration charges. Optional services include extra mid-week cleans at €45 per visit and reserved garage parking at Canal Row for €160 per month.',
	'ke44f2f95' => 'When deploying professionals, engineers, or executive teams to Calder Harbour for several months, conventional hotels feel impersonal and confined, while standard residential leases require complicated negotiations and long commitments. Sumika Residences offers an ideal solution with fifty-four serviced apartments across Ashgrove House, Canal Row, and Linden Court. Each team member has a private, fully furnished home with a dedicated timber desk, reliable high-speed Wi-Fi, and a full kitchen. Our properties offer the calm, domestic environment professionals need to rest, focus, and work effectively during extended assignments.',
	'ke59eb937' => 'A twenty-minute call',
	'ke6d28b60' => 'Quiet in the House',
	'ke6fce3e9' => 'Call the front desk from 08:00 to 20:00 on +00 20 7400 1814, or use the night line after that. Tell us your dates and which house you prefer.',
	'ke73a3d1c' => 'Inés Aldana',
	'ke8183d0a' => '5 floors · 14 apartments',
	'ke8698ebc' => 'Rates in full',
	'ke8864b2e' => 'Birch trees and benches stand in the court, and residents cross it on the way in. Lena Hartmann manages the house.',
	'ke9ca99a8' => '18:10 · back along the street',
	'kebc76572' => 'I am a cellist in Calder Harbour for an orchestra season, four months in a desk studio at Ashgrove House. Tomasz Wierzbicki manages the brick building. The tram is four minutes, the park nine. I come back, shut the door, and the room is quiet enough to sit with the day.',
	'kef5d0386' => 'Sumika Residences provides quiet, reliable accommodation for corporate project teams, engineers, visiting specialists, and relocating personnel. We offer streamlined corporate billing, flexible long-term arrangements, and individual homes that foster genuine rest.',
	'kf096b04b' => 'Twelve questions',
	'kf0c7587e' => 'A home for the team,<br>one invoice a month.',
	'kf22b87fc' => 'The people who<br>keep the keys.',
	'kf2fdcc57' => 'Can I request additional housekeeping visits?',
	'kf3eb6c91' => 'The daily comfort and reliability of our apartments depend on our dedicated operations specialists. Sofia Brandt leads our housekeeping team, supervising weekly apartment cleans, fresh linen deliveries, and common space care across all fifty-four residences. Mateo Rossi serves as our maintenance technician, overseeing heating, plumbing, electrical installations, and building fixtures. Mateo attends to maintenance inquiries promptly and discreetly, ensuring equipment operates reliably without disrupting resident schedules. Sofia and Mateo take pride in maintaining our homes to exacting domestic standards throughout every resident\'s multi-month stay.',
	'kf485b433' => 'Ravi Menon',
	'kf74e4836' => 'The walk-through',
	'kf768d664' => 'Linden Court stands in a peaceful, leafy neighbourhood renowned for its mid-century character and community atmosphere. Five everyday destinations surround the property: a neighbourhood bakery, the tram stop, a food market, the local library, and a public swimming pool. The public park is only a 4-minute walk away, offering green walking paths and quiet outdoor seating. The neighbourhood market is a 5-minute walk, providing fresh groceries throughout the week. The tram stop is 6 minutes away on foot, offering convenient links across Calder Harbour. The local bakery, library, and pool are all situated nearby in the surrounding streets.',
	'kf97457ac' => 'The minimum length of stay at Sumika Residences is thirty nights across all three of our houses: Ashgrove House, Canal Row, and Linden Court. We do not offer nightly or short-term hotel bookings. Our residences are specifically designed for people stationed in Calder Harbour for months at a time, including corporate professionals, researchers, and creative specialists. This policy preserves a calm, residential atmosphere where neighbours recognize each other and corridors remain consistently peaceful.',
	'kfd1cc816' => 'Sofia Brandt',
	'kfd3d888c' => 'Arranging a residency at Sumika Residences is direct, personal, and free of automated booking barriers. We guide each resident through a five-step process to ensure the apartment suits their stay.',
	'kfda28ed9' => 'Our houses are cared for by an experienced on-site team dedicated to quiet hospitality, dependable maintenance, and personal service. Each person brings attentiveness and craft to daily life at Sumika Residences.',
	'kfe09e78c' => 'A house inside<br>the city.',
	'kfef7fbc1' => 'Inés Aldana founded Sumika Residences in 2014 in Calder Harbour, establishing serviced residences designed for calm, multi-month stays rather than transient tourism. Inés oversees architecture, interior standards, and company direction across all three houses. Ravi Menon leads corporate stays, coordinating with companies, project teams, and relocating specialists. Ravi arranges block holds of three or more apartments, consolidated monthly invoicing, and customized corporate agreements. Together, Inés and Ravi ensure our residences provide dependable, quiet, long-term urban living with personal and attentive management.',
	'kff3058cd' => '<a class="sm-pill__btn" href="/houses/">Stays</a><a class="sm-pill__btn sm-pill__btn--enq" href="/enquire/">Enquire</a>',
